WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.630
A Dash for the Timber, 1889.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.610
This is Remington at the height
of his frontier period.

3
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.190
Cowboys gallop straight toward you,
fleeing pursuers and firing back.

4
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:16.470
It's all chaos, speed, and urgency:
cinematic before cinema existed.

5
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.490
Now notice who gets faces.

6
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.770
The cowboys are individuals,
expressive and fully human.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.490
The pursuers are a distant mass
in the dust, faceless and threatening.

8
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.710
One group has an inner life.

9
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.290
The other is background.
